    "summary": "Feed the Swarm lets each HARVESTER choose a friendly TYRANIDS unit to regenerate in your Command phase. The unit must be at most 6″ away and can benefit only once per phase. Either restore D3+1 lost wounds to a single model or bring back one slain INFANTRY model other than a CHARACTER. An ENDLESS MULTITUDE unit can bring back as many as 3 slain models in place of one.",
